AnyHop for macOS
==============

Drag AnyHop.app to Applications, then launch it from /Applications.

This build is ad-hoc signed for sideloading. It is not Developer-ID signed or
notarized, so a downloaded copy may need right-click > Open the first time.

Bundled CLI:
  /Applications/AnyHop.app/Contents/Resources/bin/anyhop

Optional background daemon:
  Use the tray's "Run Core at Login" item, or run:
  /Applications/AnyHop.app/Contents/Resources/bin/anyhop daemon install

Optional privileged TUN helper:
  sudo /Applications/AnyHop.app/Contents/Resources/bin/anyhop helper install

Uninstall:
  /Applications/AnyHop.app/Contents/Resources/bin/anyhop daemon uninstall
  sudo /Applications/AnyHop.app/Contents/Resources/bin/anyhop helper uninstall
  rm -rf /Applications/AnyHop.app

Your provider/channel state stays in ~/.anyhop unless you remove it yourself.
